# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GoblinGames core. Files load top to bottom, so the order below matters:
# libraries first, then the namespace (Init), then everything that uses it.
#
# The Interface line lists every client we support (comma-separated values
# are allowed since 10.2.7): Retail (Midnight), Mists Classic, Titan Reforged,
# TBC Anniversary and Classic Era. Code checks for missing APIs at runtime.
#
# X-Curse-Project-ID is a placeholder until the CurseForge project exists.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

